      <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Cosmic-notifications Dependencies</bridgehead>
      <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Required</bridgehead>
          <para>rustc, cargo-c, intltool, wayland, libxkbcommon, and cosmic-icons</para>

    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-notifications</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-notifications for compilation:</para>

    <para>Fetch the dependencies, ensuring the exact versions recorded in the
      existing <filename>Cargo.lock</filename> file are used:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="pre">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --profile release</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-notifications \
        /usr/bin/cosmic-notifications</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

